title: Authorizations › New case › How a case starts and resumes
route: /authorizations/new
intro: New case is a page that makes or reopens a case (a 'draft'). This diagram covers every way in and how a new case is made from the address: a referral, a verification, a patient, an authorization type or nothing. Reopening a case that exists, and what a viewer at one site can open, are in the next diagram.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the hosted preview keeps the address in memory, so ?referral= cannot be typed there. The button 'Start a case from this referral' still works in it.
---
start s1 "Open New case\nSidebar 'New case', a 'New case' button, the Demo menu, FLO's link or the old /referrals address"
start s2 "Click 'Create authorization from verification' or 'Start authorization'\non a result in Eligibility & Benefits"
start s3 "Click 'Start a case from this referral'\non the full referral page, or type ?referral=RF-2051"
start s4 "Click 'Start renewal' in the Dashboard's what-to-do list\n(opens ?type=reauth&patient=CASE-ID)"
start s5 "Type a link with ?type=\ninitial, concurrent, reauth, modify or retro"

group gMake "No case id in the address: make one"
  decision d1 "What is in the address?"
  decision dRefSite "?referral=ID: is the referral at a site in view?"
  screen scRefOut "'This referral is not available at Site A'\nNames the id and its site, nothing about the patient\nNo case is made"
  decision d2 "Is RF-2051 in the demo?"
  process p2 "Case is filled from the referral\nPatient, payer, member ID, level of care, diagnoses, reason, referrer\nRequest type: Initial request if routine, else Admission\nThe case is at the referral's site"
  store st1 "Case created on Intake, referral attached\nThe referral is the first document"
  toast t1 "'Referral RF-2051 is in this case'\n'K.R., 29. Check the details below, then go on to Eligibility & Benefits.'"
  toast t2 "Amber toast 'Referral not found'\n'We could not find RF-9999. Start from a blank case instead.'"
  decision dVer "?verification=ID: is that check at a site in view?"
  process p3 "Case is filled from the check\nPatient, payer, plan, member ID, level of care and the dates the check covers\nThe case uses that same verification record"
  decision dPat "?patient=ID: is that patient at a site in view?"
  process p4 "The patient's details, treatment episode and authorization are filled in\nNo second patient is made"
  process p5 "?type= picks the Authorization type\nIts request type is recorded: Initial request, Continued stay, Recertification, Modification or Retro-authorization"
  process p6 "Filled from ?payer=, ?program=, ?member=, ?initials=, ?age=\nRequest type: Admission\nAn unknown payer or program is ignored"
  store st3 "Blank case created at Intake\nIt belongs to the site you are working at\nNot in Case Manager until 'Save as draft'"
endgroup
process p7 "?step= opens that step: intake, eligibility, documentation, preparation or review\nThe older names referral, records and agents land on Intake, Clinical documentation and Authorization preparation"
process p8 "Case opens at /authorizations/new/draft-ID\nIt replaces the address, so Back does not loop"
goto gOpen "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Reopen and resume a case"
goto gStep "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › The stepper and the five steps"
goto gType "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Authorization type"
goto gSites "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Sites and scope"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Start with a referral or patient"

s1 --> d1
s2 --> d1
s3 --> d1
s4 --> d1
s5 --> d1
d1 -->|?referral=ID| dRefSite
dRefSite -->|No| scRefOut
dRefSite -->|Yes| d2
d2 -->|Yes| p2 --> st1 --> t1 --> p7
d2 -->|No| t2 --> st3
d1 -->|?verification=ID| dVer
dVer -->|Yes| p3 --> p7
dVer -->|No| st3
d1 -->|?patient=ID| dPat
dPat -->|Yes| p4 --> p7
dPat -->|No| st3
d1 -->|?type=| p5 --> p7
d1 -->|payer or program valid| p6 --> p7
d1 -->|Nothing usable| st3 --> p7
p7 --> p8
p8 --> gOpen
p8 -.-> gStep
p8 -.-> gType
scRefOut -.-> gSites
st1 -.-> g1
